    "text": "Disease: Bacterial Leaf Blight\nTamil Name: பாக்டீரியா இலை எரிச்சல்\nHindi Name: जीवाणु पत्ती झुलसा\nCrop: Rice\nPathogen: Xanthomonas oryzae\n\nSymptoms:\n• Water-soaked lesions on leaf tips and margins\n• Yellowing then whitening of affected areas\n• Wavy leaf margins (kresek symptom)\n• Milky bacterial ooze when cut\n• Wilting of young leaves\n\nOrganic Treatment:\n• Copper hydroxide spray @ 3g/liter\n• Pseudomonas fluorescens application\n• Maintain proper drainage\n• Remove infected plants immediately\n\nChemical Treatment:\n• Streptocycline 15% + Copper oxychloride 50% @ 2g/liter\n• Copper hydroxide 77% WP @ 3g/liter\n• Spray twice at 10-day intervals\n\nPrevention:\n• Plant resistant varieties\n• Use healthy seeds\n• Avoid excess nitrogen\n• Proper water management - avoid deep flooding\n• Clean cultivation tools\n\nFavorable Conditions:\nNot specified\n\nIntegrated Pest Management:\nNot specified",
